<title>UK: Abbey National ups bond to 200 bln lire.</title>
<headline>Abbey National ups bond to 200 bln lire.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Abbey National Treasury Services has increased to 200 billion lire from 150 billion lire the size of its 8.50 percent April 2000 bond, joint lead managers Cariplo and Credito Italiano said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The new paper is priced at 101.035. The deal was launched Monday at 100.805.</p>
<p>+ + +</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  ABBEY NATIONAL PLC (RATED AA2/AA)</p>
<p> AMT    200 BLN ITL   COUPON     8.60	MATURITY  * 06.APR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.035** PAY DATE  L 01.OCT.96</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  UK	  TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.125     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> NOTES	*CALL AT PAR ON 06.APR.98</p>
<p>		**INCLUDES 150 BLN ITL LAUNCHED 09.SEP AT 100.805.</p>
<p>		L LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
